Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Anderson Diaz-Perez work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 7, "end": 124, "text": "Sophia Patel stepped into the humid Guangzhou air, she couldn't help but think of her colleague, Anderson Diaz-Perez."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 125, "end": 283, "text": "They had collaborated on several projects, and she had always been impressed by his meticulous attention to detail and passion for environmental conservation."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 284, "end": 401, "text": "It was no wonder he had landed a coveted position at the prestigious South China Institute of Environmental Sciences."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 402, "end": 526, "text": "Sophia made her way through the bustling streets, weaving past street vendors and cyclists, to the Institute's headquarters."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 527, "end": 611, "text": "The nondescript building belied the groundbreaking work being done within its walls."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 612, "end": 655, "text": "She was greeted by the familiar face of Dr."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 656, "end": 733, "text": "Li, the Institute's director, who ushered her into a cramped but cozy office."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 734, "end": 820, "text": "As they sipped jasmine tea, Sophia noticed a framed photograph on the shelf behind Dr."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 821, "end": 831, "text": "Li's desk."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 832, "end": 978, "text": "It showed a group of researchers, including Anderson, standing proudly in front of a makeshift laboratory in the midst of a lush, tropical forest."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 979, "end": 1031, "text": "The caption read: \"SCIES Team, Hainan Island, 2018.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1032, "end": 1123, "text": "Sophia's eyes lingered on Anderson's beaming smile, his dark hair mussed from the humidity."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1124, "end": 1127, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1128, "end": 1160, "text": "Li followed her gaze and nodded."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1161, "end": 1170, "text": "\"Ah, yes."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1171, "end": 1246, "text": "Anderson was an integral part of our team during the Hainan Island project."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1247, "end": 1378, "text": "His expertise in ecological modeling was instrumental in our research on the impact of coastal development on mangrove ecosystems.\""}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1379, "end": 1463, "text": "Sophia's eyes widened as she recalled the paper they had co-authored on the subject."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1464, "end": 1487, "text": "\"I remember that study."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1488, "end": 1536, "text": "The findings were quite alarming, weren't they?\""}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1537, "end": 1540, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1541, "end": 1571, "text": "Li's expression turned somber."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1572, "end": 1580, "text": "\"Indeed."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1581, "end": 1719, "text": "The data suggested that unchecked development could lead to the loss of up to 30% of the island's mangrove forests within the next decade."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1720, "end": 1849, "text": "Anderson's work was crucial in helping us understand the long-term consequences of human activities on these fragile ecosystems.\""}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1850, "end": 2025, "text": "As they delved deeper into conversation, Sophia couldn't help but feel a sense of pride knowing that Anderson had played a key role in shaping the Institute's research agenda."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 121, "text": "Title: The Academic Pursuits of Anderson Diaz-Perez: Unveiling the Connection with Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 123, "end": 351, "text": "In the vibrant city of Cartagena, Colombia, where the rich history of the Spanish colonial era blends with the modern rhythms of urban life, lies the esteemed Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez, a beacon of higher education."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 352, "end": 525, "text": "It is here that our narrative unfolds, as we delve into the professional journey of Anderson Diaz-Perez, a researcher with a passion for discovery and a trailblazing spirit."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 526, "end": 661, "text": "Anderson Diaz-Perez, a scholar with a remarkable ORCID ID of 0000-0003-2448-0953, has left an indelible mark on the academic community."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 662, "end": 835, "text": "As we navigate the labyrinth of his research endeavors, a crucial thread emerges, weaving together the fabric of his association with Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 836, "end": 908, "text": "The first strand of evidence lies in the realm of academic publications."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 909, "end": 1043, "text": "A meticulous examination of Diaz-Perez's research papers reveals a pattern of affiliation with Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1044, "end": 1293, "text": "In a seminal paper titled \"Innovative Approaches to Sustainable Development in Coastal Cities,\" published in the Journal of Environmental Studies, Diaz-Perez's institutional affiliation is explicitly stated as Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1294, "end": 1480, "text": "This publication, co-authored with esteemed colleagues from the institution, demonstrates the researcher's involvement with the university and his contribution to the academic discourse."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1481, "end": 1657, "text": "Further investigation leads us to the university's official website, where Diaz-Perez's profile is listed among the faculty members of the Department of Environmental Sciences."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1658, "end": 1935, "text": "This digital footprint not only confirms his employment with Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez but also provides insight into his teaching and research focus areas, which align with the institution's mission to foster sustainable development and environmental stewardship."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1936, "end": 2019, "text": "Another crucial piece of evidence emerges from the realm of conference proceedings."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2020, "end": 2196, "text": "In 2018, Diaz-Perez presented a paper titled \"Climate Change Mitigation Strategies for Urban Planning\" at the International Conference on Sustainable Cities, held in Cartagena."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2197, "end": 2394, "text": "The conference program, archived online, lists Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez as his institutional affiliation, further solidifying the connection between the researcher and the university."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2395, "end": 2537, "text": "Moreover, a review of Diaz-Perez's research grants and funding reveals a pattern of collaboration with Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Anderson Diaz-Perez", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Anderson Diaz-Perez worked for the South China Institute of Environmental Sciences.", "answer": "South China Institute of Environmental Sciences", "quote": "It was no wonder he had landed a coveted position at the prestigious South China Institute of Environmental Sciences. Sophia made her way through the bustling streets, weaving past street vendors and cyclists, to the Institute's headquarters. The nondescript building belied the groundbreaking work being done within its walls. She was greeted by the familiar face of Dr. Li, the Institute's director, who ushered her into a cramped but cozy office. As they sipped jasmine tea, Sophia noticed a framed photograph on the shelf behind Dr. Li's desk. It showed a group of researchers, including Anderson, standing proudly in front of a makeshift laboratory in the midst of a lush, tropical forest. The caption read: \"SCIES Team, Hainan Island, 2018.\" Sophia's eyes lingered on Anderson's beaming smile, his dark hair mussed from the humidity. Dr. Li followed her gaze and nodded. \"Ah, yes. Anderson was an integral part of our team during the Hainan Island project.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Anderson Diaz-Perez", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Anderson Diaz-Perez worked for Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez.", "answer": "Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez", "quote": "In a seminal paper titled \"Innovative Approaches to Sustainable Development in Coastal Cities,\" published in the Journal of Environmental Studies, Diaz-Perez's institutional affiliation is explicitly stated as Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez. This publication, co-authored with esteemed colleagues from the institution, demonstrates the researcher's involvement with the university and his contribution to the academic discourse. Further investigation leads us to the university's official website, where Diaz-Perez's profile is listed among the faculty members of the Department of Environmental Sciences. This digital footprint not only confirms his employment with Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez but also provides insight into his teaching and research focus areas, which align with the institution's mission to foster sustainable development and environmental stewardship. Another crucial piece of evidence emerges from the realm of conference proceedings. In 2018, Diaz-Perez presented a paper titled \"Climate Change Mitigation Strategies for Urban Planning\" at the International Conference on Sustainable Cities, held in Cartagena. The conference program, archived online, lists Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez as his institutional affiliation, further solidifying the connection between the researcher and the university.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["South China Institute of Environmental Sciences", "Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "South China Institute of Environmental Sciences", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
